msgctxt "scenario:scenario_967DE099_5F16_462D_B99A_86EEAB3FE548"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫............"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫…………."

#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 763b491499cce51d058f9e00d579dfefa022089df34cc0ef3974e42b42e7b24a
#. default-sha256: fddde9cef5883391e59f36a0d6debac8249695972f386d84d007ba209b742bce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이봐, ⟪k:1⟫넬리. ⟪k:2⟫그렇게 뚱한 표정 좀 그만 지어. ⟪k:3⟫기껏 네가 좋아하는 연극을 같이 보"
"러 왔는데."

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f20f57b259d613d87758959c9c64eac9cebea52b090a88c7273857783f07b9e
#. default-sha256: 4f311bbd7b0f8a76ddb03952ae0a35c356f55d84f0b3dae1b0ba378437992567
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……⟪k:3⟫흥."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 263690d5e71a694e97d6f4d6154eafa0547015c9dfebb881421012819491db3e
#. default-sha256: 15f88e480b8a1be7b2152c70cd068bc00fe38111ae635d35512f22c40901956a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 날 넬리는 ⟪k:1⟫웬일로 오빠가 아닌 다른 남성과 외출했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 보시다시피 ⟪k:3⟫넬"
"리는 시종일관 불쾌해했지요."

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0caa12db38ded87d7dbca86f617a320e5274ddb7e89dcaeddc6d4cae151e6ca9
#. default-sha256: 1e6fc14c4c65acda009f0d4a282d6d44329937ed81a40350ff7987fa463822f2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(죽어도 인정 못 해……. ⟪k:1⟫이런 녀석이…… 하필 밉상스런 아서가 약혼자라니!)"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11a1e008e8c5e48da39c23a1431cc19c70571f50be0b304f20dad615b90e11f3
#. default-sha256: 91c1b186c4f6a8b8712578aff34a42427ac341f3481d479d0de2e1b95a358de7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리 옆에 있는 남성은 ⟪k:1⟫부모들끼리 정한 약혼 상대였습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0aa7f45140e4f8a1d35475e2cc80e4efe1fe699a27dd17ddfeda5e7d70b93abf
#. default-sha256: 99861df5f18bbd33facc550b0674df2b71142684f0eea1cb67987836260b0e29
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫다른 때 같으면 남성의 제의를 단칼에 거절하는 넬리였지만, ⟪k:1⟫역시 ⟪k:2⟫이번만큼은 뾰족한 수"
"가 없었기에……."

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6b52d253fa5bb9db26138ce3bedd85eb888798774ec7711af45f34c59717ba9
#. default-sha256: ff43bd9e8045665cf5c4521bbb092d1db590e489cca5d706017da51a44cff261
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫반강제적으로 ⟪k:1⟫외출했답니다."

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37b31f68aa06fd5d3e6ecdaaf6a1bfc9cedb52fb6962caa499bfa72be6b01670
#. default-sha256: 84e18322a8115d04e6164434e4f1469139a97b274fe5c0d67a71da2f4ccbf284
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫그때 넬리의 심기는 ⟪k:2⟫심히 좋지 않았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5b14ad4e2c87b2726f19cd50f30eb5a8f20eab12cbce27fbb94636f0f31cfd9
#. default-sha256: e90b355adf39dfc5185e5f4d567a1904f1a7d1c7f2f9bb17ac250794f0ceccf9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫코르셋을 조이려는 시녀를 밀치더니, ⟪k:1⟫방에 틀어박혀 ⟪k:2⟫울고불고……."

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a48d1ccd156a98cf98f89e7cdea7213f999138f8b62ee3c75626be604af78d9
#. default-sha256: 50cae9054a4557de8aa322b1b22d8a01321c2f71180dc6cb70ec6c17c7ad933f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 여럿이서 넬리를 치장시켜 ⟪k:1⟫약혼자와…… 예, ⟪k:2⟫데이트겠군요, ⟪k:3⟫데이트를 보냈습니"
"다."

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48c19ae1abd0599e9aae26c55b64e2012a316e3d9faf318e80bd30ea81fff3bc
#. default-sha256: 5bdafb8984339b6a2be419bb0f7bcc16a1dfe279ea3fb64fd31d787165f6c9f5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫얘 쫌, ⟪k:4⟫더 즐기는 내색을 해야지.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫우리 사이가 험악한 줄 알 거 아니"
"야?"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd9f7a9373acd0ba61bbcf584bb40dc03e57dd9ef74fdf6aa32de7155f24589e
#. default-sha256: 82c9a07a9c33f72e0c3a2440bed9935455220a2fbe3859a8a7b27ebbb68b1782
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫실제로 ⟪k:2⟫좋지도 않잖아."

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 274d345dd901611a960ccffb3bdce27b66cb2a4046a2abc47a6053fe3d991806
#. default-sha256: c1ed836ea54c6a95d425bdb2cde256f5db935b44974f4c18e87c7f27f638b6cb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫돌겠네……. 나는 너랑 원만히 지내고 싶은데."

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d650cf9131613b717051f4d4ce96a290e29961a806f74d7a1979718793bbdfbd
#. default-sha256: 5237769a298e45d293fa02d22db54c9512c23d94d6ef7bb5258ce6bbc42df309
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네가 원만히 지내려는 건 ⟪k:2⟫넬리가 아니라 ⟪k:3⟫우리 집안이잖아……."

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d21e7a2d9aa7f5dee7ade95e7bdfb09bbd6607ebeaa7174578caf1ff5f88851a
#. default-sha256: 2f4bb77d406e570ac695da84899541642b58e189ac2565ba4888f440448d7e18
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그걸 말하기야? ⟪k:3⟫이렇게 네가 좋아하는 작품을 보러 와 줬잖아. ⟪k:4⟫좀 더 살갑게 "
"굴지 그래."

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58f52217a23cd459840e30d066c79a20b02c2710fb197c6aaa47bf38f61189be
#. default-sha256: 7ad4cbbcf9afaeed3a4ea614548ad67d57ba1310b03351d01d3079e8591dd1ef
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 작품…… 로미오와 줄리엣이던가, ⟪k:1⟫6, 7년째 계속 하지?"

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87c6cc922537f5693553b2a615d172ce17c1ea57e16811a58b291c791b89755f
#. default-sha256: 2786774937b14c0598c6c4f786f36837c6751a96d32d74093839b963677e2b9b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나하고 네 집안이라면 ⟪k:1⟫각본가한테 새 작품을 쓰게 할 수도 있는데 말이야."

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fff0ad7b04101722deb7a7187cc4ff036674b0a72be838e8116bd28270a3dc27
#. default-sha256: c273c3ae64f46e59356e3494039fcce56fe7722828de113019b45ec9a0da2fc9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫도대체 왜 ⟪k:1⟫사설극장이라지만 ⟪k:2⟫중류 계급만 있는 극장에서 보나 몰라……. ⟪k:3⟫하아~ ⟪k:4⟫"
"연극은 내 방에서 하면 그만――"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3320a628e6b5f45ec2e11669e3ddfae1b4a7067f0e8697d0a21838abcd01020f
#. default-sha256: 219f40bf78783059526ca2fb3ae57969ff7b6e78724c893dbead1c00dc47d7bf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫――그만 좀 떠들어!"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c72fef626c396da4e18595919b5b06dcdbae2d3b1b82fba503ff8b2557dcab6e
#. default-sha256: 59b2913d5e649d28d5cf1a447fbd49feb4588cb5adb61858bea6513ece227d43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너 같은…… 너 같은 녀석하고 ⟪k:2⟫넬리가 왜 결혼해야 해!? ⟪k:3⟫넬리는 죽어도, ⟪k:4⟫주우우"
"욱어도 싫어!"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1fdf701ea844089b1f711a65ae9088ed6faa17e9c68f52c4a046619d4564703
#. default-sha256: 07b929a14cec8f009eed93711199c9015356fb9bfa1b4e04bb695d61280f328a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫반드시 중단시킬 거야! ⟪k:1⟫아버님한테 입이 닳도록 말할래!"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
